    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="The Poincare recurrence theorem guarantees that, for a measure-preserving system, almost every trajectory returns arbitrarily close to its starting point infinitely often. A trajectory&#x27;s recurrence structure is captured by the pairwise recurrence matrix">

